Add mullvad-daemon after dbus in the SERVICES array in /etc/rc.conf.
The GUI requires the daemon to be running.

/opt/Mullvad VPN/chrome-sandbox and /usr/bin/mullvad-exclude are installed
setuid root. Split tunneling requires cgroups.

Stopping the daemon may leave the firewall blocking traffic. To remove these
rules after stopping it, run as root:

"/opt/Mullvad VPN/resources/mullvad-setup" reset-firewall

Early-boot blocking is not enabled by this port. For protection before networking,
run after local filesystems are mounted and before network services:

/usr/bin/mullvad-daemon --initialize-early-boot-firewall
